  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Runtime",
      "items": [
        "A client-only single-page app: no server code in this repo",
        "A HashRouter serves / and /projects; unknown addresses go home",
        "Both pages use the same symmetric page padding (120px top and bottom) and the body has none, so the home and Projects glass panels are centred on the window's middle line, level with the centred site menu",
        "Both glass panels share one .glass: same width, left edge and monospace font. The home panel has roomier inner padding; it holds the name, the Betabit role subline and the newest project (projects[0]); the name button toggles the cat",
        "The four hidden Poke Balls live inside the home glass panel, anchored to it, with the counter just above the panel's top edge",
        "The only persisted state is the colour index in localStorage"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Theme",
      "items": [
        "The matrix colour and the site theme are one index, owned by ThemeProvider",
        "main.tsx applies the stored theme before React renders, then turns the fade on",
        "CSS modules read --accent tokens on html; clicking the rain changes them all"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Delivery",
      "items": [
        "Every push and pull request runs check, build and e2e",
        "Deploy needs all three and runs only on main",
        "The custom domain and HTTPS live in the Pages settings, not in a file"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Tests",
      "items": [
        "Vitest unit tests sit beside the code in src/, including theme contrast and token use",
        "Playwright tests the exact dist the build job produced, on desktop and mobile"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
